		<member name="stateless" c:identifier="OMNI_TRANSFORMER_FEATURE_FLAGS_STATELESS" value="1">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">The transformer is stateless.

A stateless transformer does not maintain state data that needs to be carried over between batches. The system can instruct the transformer to 
produce output batches in any order.</doc>
		</member>
		<member name="state_serializable" c:identifier="OMNI_TRANSFORMER_FEATURE_FLAGS_STATE_SERIALIZABLE" value="2">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">The transformer supports state serialization.

Ignored if `STATELESS` is set.

If this flag is set, the system is allowed to call
`Omni.TransformerState.serialize_async` and
`Omni.TransformerState.deserialize_from_async`.</doc>
		</member>
	</bitfield>
