		<member name="start_closed" c:identifier="OMNI_STREAM_STATE_FLAGS_START_CLOSED" value="2">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">The stream's starting point is closed (i.e., `Tₛ = fTₛ` is known).

