		<member name="end_closed" c:identifier="OMNI_STREAM_STATE_FLAGS_END_CLOSED" value="4">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">The stream's ending point is closed (i.e., `Tₑ = fTₑ` is known).

If the stream contains no batches, this is equivalent to the stream being
