		<member name="multiple" c:identifier="OMNI_LINK_POLICY_FLAGS_MULTIPLE" value="1">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">The port property accepts multiple links.

If this flag is not set, an [iface@Omni.LinkArray] assigned to the property
will contain exactly one link.</doc>
		</member>
		<member name="default_quant_each" c:identifier="OMNI_LINK_POLICY_FLAGS_DEFAULT_QUANT_EACH" value="2">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Change the port property's default quantification mode to Each (create one tool instance for every matching port).

If this flag is not set, the default quantification mode is All (create one tool instance for all matching port and raise error if 
