successful call to this method, `source_state` remains usable and
unchanged.

`source_state` must point to a different object created by a logically
equal ([method@Omni.Transformer.eq]) instance of [iface@Omni.Transformer].

Even though this method is defined as fallible, it is only allowed to
throw [error@Gio.IOErrorEnum.CANCELLED] at the moment. (This does not need
to be observed if preconditions are violated.)

This method is never called when
[flags@Omni.TransformerFeatureFlags.STATELESS] is set. Otherwise,
override it when moving state is more efficient than copying.
The default implementation copies the state through
[method@Omni.TransformerState.copy_from_async].
