		<method name="transform_uniform_async" c:identifier="omni_transformer_state_transform_uniform_async">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Produce output batches for a certain time range.

Before returning, this method must call the following methods on
`context` in order:

- Call [method@Omni.TransformUniformContext.advance] zero or more times.

- Call [method@Omni.TransformUniformContext.blocked_by] once.
  This is optional and ignored if
  [method@Omni.TransformUniformContext.advance] was called at least once.

It is recommended to impose a finite bound on the amount of work
(by some measure) performed during a single method call.
For example, it could return to the caller as soon as the above call
order requirement is fulfilled.</doc>
