		<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Represents an input source.

This object provides properties to select and configure data collection
mechanisms, such as the serial number of a hardware device to attach.

All properties must be of variant-compatible types. See `Omni.Tool` for
the definition of variant-compatible types.

Any operations done through this class should not affect the state of
external components until it's explicitly activated by
`Omni.SourcePlan.activate`.</doc>
