				</instance-parameter>
			</parameters>
		</method>
		<virtual-method name="get_stale" invoker="get_stale">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Get a flag indicating whether this snapshot has become out-of-date due to
changes in the input source state.

The owner of this object can monitor for `stale-changed` signals to
detect when it needs to reacquire a snapshot.

If a snapshot becomes out-of-date, planning and activation operations on
objects derived from that snapshot may (but are not required to) fail
with [error@Omni.Error.SNAPSHOT_OUT_OF_DATE].
    </doc>
			<return-value transfer-ownership="full">
				<type name="gboolean" c:type="gboolean"/>
			</return-value>
			<parameters>
