		<method name="dup_port_attributes" c:identifier="omni_source_snapshot_dup_port_attributes">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Get the port attribute set (variant of type `a{sv}`) of the port at the
specified index.

`i` must be less than `num_ports`.

The method is not intended to be called more than once for each port. It
is performance-wise acceptable for the method implementation to construct
a new `GLib.Variant` instance on every call.

# Standard Attributes

The following standard attribute is defined:

- `name` (type `s`) optionally specifies the port's user-friendly name.

Attribute names starting with `-` are reserved for system-generated
attributes and must not be used by input source implementations.</doc>
			<return-value transfer-ownership="full">
				<type name="GLib.Variant" c:type="GVariant*"/>
			</return-value>
			<parameters>
				<instance-parameter name="self" transfer-ownership="none">
					<type name="Omni.SourceSnapshot" c:type="OmniSourceSnapshot*"/>
				</instance-parameter>
				<parameter name="i" transfer-ownership="none">
					<type name="guint" c:type="guint"/>
				</parameter>
			</parameters>
		</method>
		<virtual-method name="dup_port_attributes" invoker="dup_port_attributes">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Get the port attribute set (variant of type `a{sv}`) of the port at the
specified index.

`i` must be less than `num_ports`.

The method is not intended to be called more than once for each port. It
is performance-wise acceptable for the method implementation to construct
a new `GLib.Variant` instance on every call.

# Standard Attributes

The following standard attribute is defined:

- `name` (type `s`) optionally specifies the port's user-friendly name.

Attribute names starting with `-` are reserved for system-generated
attributes and must not be used by input source implementations.</doc>
			<return-value transfer-ownership="full">
				<type name="GLib.Variant" c:type="GVariant*"/>
			</return-value>
			<parameters>
				<instance-parameter name="self" transfer-ownership="none">
					<type name="Omni.SourceSnapshot" c:type="OmniSourceSnapshot*"/>
