				</instance-parameter>
				<parameter name="schema" transfer-ownership="none">
					<type name="Omni.ArrowSchema" c:type="OmniArrowSchema*"/>
				</parameter>
			</parameters>
		</method>
		<virtual-method name="add_table_stream" invoker="add_table_stream">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Add a table input stream.

This method returns an [iface@Omni.StreamBuilder] object that can be used
to configure the details of the created stream.

The [property@Omni.StreamBuilder:handle] property of this object provides an
a handle representing the stream. During activation, an input source can
pass it to [method@Omni.SourceActivateContext.dup_stream_sink] to
get the stream sink and start feeding data to it.</doc>
			<return-value transfer-ownership="full">
				<type name="Omni.StreamBuilder" c:type="OmniStreamBuilder*"/>
			</return-value>
			<parameters>
				<instance-parameter name="self" transfer-ownership="none">
