				</parameter>
			</parameters>
		</virtual-method>
		<property name="dry-run">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Get a flag indicating whether a dry-run mode is active in the current
planning operation.

The dry-run mode is designed to be used while the user is configuring an
analysis session to provide immediate feedback about the validity of
configuration. When this mode is active, the `plan_async` method should
refrain from performing potentially time-consuming or side-effectful
operations, such as accessing memory on a debug target and sending
network requests.

A plan created in a dry-run mode will never be activated (i.e.,
`Omni.SourcePlan.activate_async` will never be called).</doc>
			<type name="gboolean" c:type="gboolean"/>
		</property>
