		<method name="start" c:identifier="omni_active_source_start">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Start data collection.

This operation can be done only once, whether successful or not, for
each instance of this object.

The input source must attempt to start collection and call one of the
following methods:

- [method@Omni.SourceActivateContext.started] if successful

- [method@Omni.SourceActivateContext.finish] with non-null error
  if unsuccessful.

Calling the above methods synchronously from `start` is allowed.

After calling [method@Omni.SourceActivateContext.started], this method
may immediately and synchronously call
[method@Omni.SourceActivateContext.finish] with null error if there is no
data to produce.</doc>
