completion.

This is the synchronous version of [method@Omni.StreamSink.feed_table_batch_async]. It can
be significantly easier to use in some language bindings, but you should
avoid it whenever possible because of the following limitations:

- **Calling it from a GLib event loop is prohibited.** In general, you
  should only call it from a worker thread unassociated with a GLib main
  context.

- Because of the blocking operation, the calling thread can not perform
  other tasks while the operation is in progress, potentially resulting
  in less efficient use of hardware resources.

See [method@Omni.StreamSink.feed_table_batch_async] for usage of this method.</doc>
