**Warning: Using this method is discouraged until the feature is fully
supported by the application.**
Currently, the application accepts SPK specifications, but it does not
build an associated index structure or validate the provided keys.
Therefore, plugins using it incorrectly will stop working when SPK
support is finally implemented.
You must not use this method unless you are aware of the exact criteria
that SPK values must conform to.
    </doc>
