		<property name="group-values" readable="0" writable="1">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Specifies static grouping field values for subtracks.

Set this property to a non-null value to enable static subtracks. Each
record row is rendered as a subtrack, where the visualizers only display
the events having the matching grouping field values.

To enable dynamic subtracks, leave this property set to `null` and call
[method@Omni.TrackBuilder.append_group_field_with_sql] at least once.

The record batch must contain at least one row and one field.

The rows must be organized in a hierarchical manner. The provided batch
must contain a list of leaf node paths of a [prefix tree][1] where the
`i`-th level nodes hold `i`-th level grouping field values, sorted by
an arbitrary depth-first-search order.

&gt; A lexicographical order meets this criterion.

&gt; By the above definition, the rows must be distinct from each other.

Not every visualizer supports subtracks. Enabling subtracks in a track
with an unsupported summary visualizer will result in a planning error.
Unsupported detail visualizers are hidden when a subtrack, instead of the
whole track, is selected.

Setting this property to `null` disables static subtracks. It disables
subtracks altogether only if no grouping fields are defined.

[1]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trie
    </doc>
			<type name="Omni.ArrowRecordBatch" c:type="OmniArrowRecordBatch*"/>
		</property>
		<method name="set_group_values" c:identifier="omni_track_builder_set_group_values">
			<return-value transfer-ownership="none">
				<type name="none" c:type="void"/>
			</return-value>
			<parameters>
				<instance-parameter name="self" transfer-ownership="none">
					<type name="Omni.TrackBuilder" c:type="OmniTrackBuilder*"/>
				</instance-parameter>
				<parameter name="value" transfer-ownership="none" nullable="1">
					<type name="Omni.ArrowRecordBatch" c:type="OmniArrowRecordBatch*"/>
				</parameter>
			</parameters>
		</method>
		<virtual-method name="set_group_values" invoker="set_group_values">
			<return-value transfer-ownership="none">
				<type name="none" c:type="void"/>
			</return-value>
			<parameters>
				<instance-parameter name="self" transfer-ownership="none">
					<type name="Omni.TrackBuilder" c:type="OmniTrackBuilder*"/>
				</instance-parameter>
				<parameter name="value" transfer-ownership="none" nullable="1">
					<type name="Omni.ArrowRecordBatch" c:type="OmniArrowRecordBatch*"/>
				</parameter>
			</parameters>
		</virtual-method>
	</interface>
