		<property name="color-field-name" readable="0" writable="1">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Specifies the name of the color field.

The following field types are supported:

- `[U]Int32`: An sRGB color value, encoded as three 8-bit fixed-point
  values, each representing red, green, and blue, packed into a 32-bit
  integer from the least significant bits.
    </doc>
			<type name="utf8" c:type="gchar*"/>
