			</parameters>
		</virtual-method>
		<property name="cross-subtrack" readable="0" writable="1">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Specifies whether the start and end events may belong to different
subtracks. Defaults to `false` when unspecified.

# Limitations

Cross-subtrack span layers have the following limitations:

- The spans can be displayed only after their end events are
  registered.

- Labels are not supported.

- The rendering performance may be significantly lower.
  
    </doc>
