		<method name="add_value_tick" c:identifier="omni_plot_summary_builder_add_value_tick">
			<doc xml:whitespace="preserve" filename="" line="0">Add a value tick.

The tick labels are displayed in the same area as the value range labels
(controlled by [property@Omni.PlotSummaryBuilder:show-value-range-min] and
